---
description: String Razor component parameters need @ before a field name, or the dialog shows the field name
alwaysApply: true
---

# Text parameters need `@`

`Message="_field"` passes the literal text "_field" to a string parameter, so the dialog shows the variable name. Always write `Message="@_field"` for string parameters (Message, Title, RepoName, ...). Only non-string parameters (bool, int, objects) may omit the `@`. `RazorStringParameterLiteralTests` guards the common names.
